  m_text: 'Code Escape supports the UN Sustainable Development Goal 4: <color=#4ADE80>Quality
    Education</color>.


    Players build beginner programming skills in Python,
    PHP or SQL by solving puzzles: variables, conditions, loops, functions and data
    queries, with instant feedback and explanations.


    This links to SDG target
    4.4: more young people with the technical skills they need for future work.'
